          },
          {
            "Text": "Person or Organization URN",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Author of the post (can be either posted as member or their company page). For Person URN, refer Retrieve Current Member\u0027s Profile API to fetch their id and construct a Person URN in the format of urn:li:person:{id}. For Organization URN, refer Find a Member\u0027s Organization API to fetch their organization and validate their organization access role.",
            "Links": [
              "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/linkedin/shared/integrations/people/profile-api?view=li-lms-2026-09#retrieve-current-members-profile",
              "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/linkedin/marketing/community-management/organizations/organization-access-control-by-role?view=li-lms-2026-09#find-a-members-organization-access-control-information"
            ],
            "Values": [
              "For Person URN, refer Retrieve Current Member\u0027s Profile API to fetch their id and construct a Person URN in the format of urn:li:person:{id}.",
              "For Organization URN, refer Find a Member\u0027s Organization API to fetch their organization and validate their organization access role."
            ]
          },
          {
            "Text": "create-only required",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "adContext",
