            "Text": "boolean default=false",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Indicates whether resharing of the post has been disabled by the author. If this field is set to true, the post can\u0027t be reshared in any context. If false, other reshare restrictions may still apply due to the post\u0027s visibility, container, or content type.",
