          {
            "Text": "The context in which the post was re-shared - only be set for re-shares. This field contains information about the reshare context:parent: URN type the direct parent of the post (i.e.,the post that was re-shared).root: The greatest ancestor of the post - may also be the parent. This field is derived from the parent and supports the same URN types. root is read-only.",
